{"product_id":"diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-09-the-long-haul","title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid 09. The Long Haul","description":"\u003cp\u003eA family road trip is supposed to be a lot of fun . . . unless, of course, you’re the Heffleys. The journey starts off full of promise, then quickly takes several wrong turns. Gas station bathrooms, crazed seagulls, a fender bender, and a runaway pig—not exactly Greg Heffley’s idea of a good time. But even the worst road trip can turn into an adventure—and this is one the Heffleys won’t soon forget.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeff Kinney\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781419717604\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 20 x 141\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595575169177,"sku":"9RC9781419717604","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-09-the-long-haul-135659.jpg?v=1694790252","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-09-the-long-haul","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}